  "title": "Coast Guard Rescues 4 kayakers off the coast of Trinidad",
  "description": "A Coast Guard Sector Humboldt Bay MH-65 Dolphin helicopter crew and a Coast Guard Station Humboldt Bay 47-foot motor lifeboat crew rescues four kayakers off the coast of Trinidad Head, California, Feb. 14, 2021. The Dolphin crew transported two kayakers to Air Station Humboldt Bay with no reported medical concerns and the small boat crew took the other two kayakers to Station Humboldt Bay with no reported medical concerns. (U.S. Coast Guard video by Coast Guard Sector Humboldt Bay).",
